#       Copyright (c) 2022, MacDue <macdue@dueutil.tech>
#       Copyright (c) 2024, Shannon Booth <shannon@serenityos.org>
#       Copyright (c) 2024, Tommy van der Vorst <tommy@pixelspark.nl>
